InfraFence connects this firewall to the InfraFence dashboard. The agent
reads the pf filter log, Suricata alerts, SSH, web GUI and OpenVPN login
failures, reports them, and blocks attackers (local and network-wide
bans, threat feed, blocked countries) through three pf tables behind
the infrafence_* aliases. The plugin only adds block rules; it never
opens anything.

WWW: https://infrafence.com
